#   Earth rotation parameters      > %%%%%%%%%%% <  (mandatory if ERPs present)# POLE
#   Geocenter coordinates          > %%%%%%%%%%% <                             # GCCINP
#   Satellite clock corrections    > %%%%%%%%%%% <                             # SATCLK
