# BEGIN_PANEL ALD_ELIM / _ OR OLD_ELIM / _ OR HLD_ELIM / _ #####################
# ADDNEQ2 20: Options for Parameter Scaling Factors                            #
#                                                                              #
# ATMOSPHERIC PRESSURE LOADING                                                 #
#   Parameter setup                  > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%% <    # ALOADSET ALOADCLU
#   Parameter decomposition          > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <                    # ALOADDEC
#   Constrain scaling factors to     > %%%%%%%% <                              # ALOAD10
#   Sigma in North/horizontal/overall> %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ALOADSIG1
#   @@@@@@@@@East@/vertical          > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ALOADSIG2
#   @@@@@@@@@Up                      > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ALOADSIG3
#                                                                              #
# OCEAN NON-TIDAL LOADING                                                      #
#   Parameter setup                  > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%% <    # ONTLDSET ONTLDCLU
#   Parameter decomposition          > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <                    # ONTLDDEC
#   Constrain scaling factors to     > %%%%%%%% <                              # ONTLD10
#   Sigma in North/horizontal/overall> %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ONTLDSIG1
#   @@@@@@@@@East@/vertical          > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ONTLDSIG2
#   @@@@@@@@@Up                      > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # ONTLDSIG3
#                                                                              #
# HYDROSTATIC PRESSURE LOADING                                                 #
#   Parameter setup                  > %%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%% <    > %%%%%%%% <    # HLOADSET HLOADCLU
