#   Constrain scaling factors to     > %%%% <                                  # HLOAD10
#   Sigma in North/horizontal/overall> %%%%%%%% < meters                       # HLOADSIG1
#   @@@@@@@@@East@/vertical          > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # HLOADSIG2
#   @@@@@@@@@Up                      > %%%%%%%% < meters                       # HLOADSIG3
# END_PANEL ####################################################################


